rem 한 손 한글 — 행 분리 조합 (RFC-0007). 왼손 여덟 글쇠와 엄지 셋으로 한글·영문·기호·숫자·이동·펑션을 다 친다.
rem   이 파일은 jamotong-private/tools/gen_onehand.py 가 만든다 — 고칠 때는 그 표를 고친다.
rem
rem   한글(기본 층): 윗줄 q w e r 을 함께 누르면 자음, 아랫줄 a s d f 를 함께 누르면 모음. 한 조합을 다 뗀 뒤 다음
rem     조합을 누른다. 낱자는 두벌식 오토마타로 들어간다 — 받침·도깨비불·겹받침은 두벌식과 같다.
rem     된소리: 윗줄 넷을 함께 눌렀다 떼고 평음(q+w+e+r 다음 ㄱ = ㄲ). 자음 두 번은 받침과 다음 초성(먹고).
rem     ㅘ ㅙ ㅚ ㅝ ㅞ ㅟ 는 모음 두 개(ㅗ ㅏ = ㅘ).
rem   엄지(어느 층에서나): space 탭 = 띄어쓰기.
rem     v 를 누른 채: f 영문 · r 한글 · d 기호 · e 숫자 · w 괄호 · s 이동 · a 펑션 · q 낱자 (층을 바꿔 둔다)
rem     b 를 누른 채: f Ctrl · d Shift · s Alt · a Win · r 오른Ctrl · e 오른Shift · w 오른Alt (다음 키 하나에) · q Tab
rem     space 를 누른 채: f Backspace · d Space · s Enter · a Delete · r Tab · e Esc
rem   단축키(Ctrl+C 등)는 영문 층에서 친다 — 영문 글자는 실제 글쇠로 나가 수식키가 얹힌다.

layout name "한 손 한글" .
layout abbrev "KO1H" .
layout format 4 .
layout license "자모통 RFC-0007 의 배열. 이 파일의 표기는 자모통의 것이다." .
engine hangul .

keys "qwer" "asdf" "vb " .
chordterm 50 .
holdterm 200 .

rem 한글 — 윗줄 자음 열넷, 아랫줄 모음 열다섯 (§12)
chord "e"    be symbol "ㅇ" .
chord "r"    be symbol "ㄴ" .
chord "er"   be symbol "ㄱ" .
chord "w"    be symbol "ㄹ" .
chord "ew"   be symbol "ㅅ" .
chord "rw"   be symbol "ㄷ" .
chord "erw"  be symbol "ㅈ" .
chord "q"    be symbol "ㅎ" .
chord "qw"   be symbol "ㅁ" .
chord "eq"   be symbol "ㅂ" .
chord "qr"   be symbol "ㅌ" .
chord "eqw"  be symbol "ㅊ" .
chord "qrw"  be symbol "ㅍ" .
chord "eqr"  be symbol "ㅋ" .
chord "d"    be symbol "ㅏ" .
chord "f"    be symbol "ㅣ" .
chord "df"   be symbol "ㅡ" .
chord "s"    be symbol "ㅗ" .
chord "ds"   be symbol "ㅓ" .
chord "fs"   be symbol "ㅜ" .
chord "dfs"  be symbol "ㅕ" .
chord "a"    be symbol "ㅔ" .
chord "as"   be symbol "ㅐ" .
chord "ad"   be symbol "ㅢ" .
chord "af"   be symbol "ㅛ" .
chord "ads"  be symbol "ㅠ" .
chord "afs"  be symbol "ㅑ" .
chord "adf"  be symbol "ㅖ" .
chord "adfs" be symbol "ㅒ" .

rem 된소리 — 윗줄 넷이 다음 조합 하나를 된소리 면으로 (원샷, §15.2)
chord "qwer" be layer tense .
chord " "  be text " " .
hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .

layer tense do
  chord "er"   be symbol "ㄲ" .
  chord "rw"   be symbol "ㄸ" .
  chord "eq"   be symbol "ㅃ" .
  chord "ew"   be symbol "ㅆ" .
  chord "erw"  be symbol "ㅉ" .
end

rem v 를 누른 채 — 층 바꾸기 (§6.1.1)
layer gate do
  chord "f" be switch (layer eng) .
  chord "r" be switch (layer base) .
  chord "d" be switch (layer sym) .
  chord "s" be switch (layer nav) .
  chord "a" be switch (layer fn) .
  chord "e" be switch (layer num) .
  chord "q" be switch (layer jamo) .
  chord "w" be switch (layer brk) .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem b 를 누른 채 — 다음 키 하나에 얹는 수식키, 겹쳐 걸 수 있다 (§6.2)
layer mods do
  chord "f" be mod ctrl .
  chord "d" be mod shift .
  chord "s" be mod alt .
  chord "a" be mod win .
  chord "r" be mod rctrl .
  chord "e" be mod rshift .
  chord "w" be mod ralt .
  chord "q" be key tab .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem space 를 누른 채 — 편집 글쇠 (§6.1.1)
layer edit do
  chord "f" be key back .
  chord "d" be text " " .
  chord "s" be key enter .
  chord "a" be key delete .
  chord "r" be key tab .
  chord "e" be key esc .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem L1 영문 (§11.6) — 실제 글쇠로 나가 Shift·Ctrl 이 얹힌다
layer eng do
  chord "f"    be key e .
  chord "d"    be key t .
  chord "s"    be key a .
  chord "r"    be key c .
  chord "e"    be key r .
  chord "a"    be key v .
  chord "w"    be key d .
  chord "q"    be key y .
  chord "fd"   be key s .
  chord "ds"   be key n .
  chord "re"   be key o .
  chord "fs"   be key i .
  chord "fe"   be key f .
  chord "se"   be key z .
  chord "sa"   be key x .
  chord "ew"   be key p .
  chord "fa"   be key l .
  chord "da"   be key u .
  chord "rw"   be key w .
  chord "aw"   be key b .
  chord "ra"   be key g .
  chord "ea"   be key h .
  chord "dr"   be key m .
  chord "wq"   be key k .
  chord "fw"   be key j .
  chord "sr"   be key q .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem L2 기호 (§11.7 ①)
layer sym do
  chord "f"    be text "_" .
  chord "d"    be text "," .
  chord "s"    be text ">" .
  chord "r"    be text "-" .
  chord "e"    be text "." .
  chord "a"    be text ";" .
  chord "w"    be text ":" .
  chord "q"    be text "$" .
  chord "fd"   be text "\"" .
  chord "ds"   be text "<" .
  chord "re"   be text "/" .
  chord "fs"   be text "=" .
  chord "fe"   be text "*" .
  chord "se"   be text "&" .
  chord "sa"   be text "+" .
  chord "ew"   be text "#" .
  chord "fa"   be text "|" .
  chord "da"   be text "\\" .
  chord "rw"   be text "!" .
  chord "aw"   be text "~" .
  chord "ra"   be text "^" .
  chord "fds"  be text "'" .
  chord "dsa"  be text "`" .
  chord "rew"  be text "?" .
  chord "fda"  be text "%" .
  chord "fsa"  be text "@" .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem L2 괄호 쌍 (§11.7 ②) — 위 = 여는, 홈 = 닫는
layer brk do
  chord "r" be text "(" .
  chord "f" be text ")" .
  chord "e" be text "{" .
  chord "d" be text "}" .
  chord "w" be text "[" .
  chord "s" be text "]" .
  chord "q" be text "<" .
  chord "a" be text ">" .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem L2 숫자 (§11.7 ③)
layer num do
  chord "f" be text "1" .
  chord "d" be text "2" .
  chord "s" be text "3" .
  chord "a" be text "4" .
  chord "r" be text "5" .
  chord "e" be text "6" .
  chord "w" be text "7" .
  chord "q" be text "8" .
  chord "fd" be text "9" .
  chord "fs" be text "0" .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem L3 이동 (§11.8) — 수식키가 얹힌다(Shift+화살표로 고르기)
layer nav do
  chord "e" be key up .
  chord "d" be key down .
  chord "s" be key left .
  chord "f" be key right .
  chord "q" be key home .
  chord "a" be key End .
  chord "w" be key pgup .
  chord "r" be key pgdn .
  chord "fd" be key delete .
  chord "sa" be key insert .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem L4 펑션 (§11.8)
layer fn do
  chord "q" be key f1 .
  chord "w" be key f2 .
  chord "e" be key f3 .
  chord "r" be key f4 .
  chord "a" be key f5 .
  chord "s" be key f6 .
  chord "d" be key f7 .
  chord "f" be key f8 .
  chord "qw" be key f9 .
  chord "we" be key f10 .
  chord "er" be key f11 .
  chord "as" be key f12 .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

rem 낱자 — 오토마타를 거치지 않는 자모(ㅋㅋ·ㅠㅠ). 윗줄 자음, 아랫줄 모음
layer jamo do
  chord "e"    be text "ㅇ" .
  chord "r"    be text "ㄴ" .
  chord "er"   be text "ㄱ" .
  chord "w"    be text "ㄹ" .
  chord "ew"   be text "ㅅ" .
  chord "rw"   be text "ㄷ" .
  chord "erw"  be text "ㅈ" .
  chord "q"    be text "ㅎ" .
  chord "qw"   be text "ㅁ" .
  chord "eq"   be text "ㅂ" .
  chord "qr"   be text "ㅌ" .
  chord "eqw"  be text "ㅊ" .
  chord "qrw"  be text "ㅍ" .
  chord "eqr"  be text "ㅋ" .
  chord "d"    be text "ㅏ" .
  chord "f"    be text "ㅣ" .
  chord "df"   be text "ㅡ" .
  chord "s"    be text "ㅗ" .
  chord "ds"   be text "ㅓ" .
  chord "fs"   be text "ㅜ" .
  chord "dfs"  be text "ㅕ" .
  chord "a"    be text "ㅔ" .
  chord "as"   be text "ㅐ" .
  chord "ad"   be text "ㅢ" .
  chord "af"   be text "ㅛ" .
  chord "ads"  be text "ㅠ" .
  chord "afs"  be text "ㅑ" .
  chord "adf"  be text "ㅖ" .
  chord "adfs" be text "ㅒ" .
  chord "qwer" be layer jamotense .
  chord " "  be text " " .
  hold  "v"  be momentary (layer gate) .
  hold  "b"  be momentary (layer mods) .
  hold  " "  be momentary (layer edit) .
end

layer jamotense do
  chord "er"   be text "ㄲ" .
  chord "rw"   be text "ㄸ" .
  chord "eq"   be text "ㅃ" .
  chord "ew"   be text "ㅆ" .
  chord "erw"  be text "ㅉ" .
end

rem 겹받침
combine jong "ㄱ" "ㅅ" be "ㄳ" .
combine jong "ㄴ" "ㅈ" be "ㄵ" .
combine jong "ㄴ" "ㅎ" be "ㄶ" .
combine jong "ㄹ" "ㄱ" be "ㄺ" .
combine jong "ㄹ" "ㅁ" be "ㄻ" .
combine jong "ㄹ" "ㅂ" be "ㄼ" .
combine jong "ㄹ" "ㅅ" be "ㄽ" .
combine jong "ㄹ" "ㅌ" be "ㄾ" .
combine jong "ㄹ" "ㅍ" be "ㄿ" .
combine jong "ㄹ" "ㅎ" be "ㅀ" .
combine jong "ㅂ" "ㅅ" be "ㅄ" .

rem 겹모음
combine mid "ㅗ" "ㅏ" be "ㅘ" .
combine mid "ㅗ" "ㅐ" be "ㅙ" .
combine mid "ㅗ" "ㅣ" be "ㅚ" .
combine mid "ㅜ" "ㅓ" be "ㅝ" .
combine mid "ㅜ" "ㅔ" be "ㅞ" .
combine mid "ㅜ" "ㅣ" be "ㅟ" .
combine mid "ㅡ" "ㅣ" be "ㅢ" .
